\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{What survives a change of resolution?}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{Which laws survive a change of resolution is one of the [questions about the grid](fdip-00AU). Subdivision of a cubical cochain has an exact boundary identity in \ref{fdip-00OW}. The product and adjoint in the examples of \ref{fdip-00P1} behave differently. For a spin field the basic question starts on the sites. Which fine momenta take the same values there?}
